<!doctype html><html lang="zh-CN" data-site-prefix="../" data-page-kind="topic"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>全局变量：同流程、跨流程与停止 · 架构逆向与实现对照文档</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="../公共资源/样式/542ae2d5e2de76f7a482e81bed7afe56395d5076e55bb540bec24f2862bef6e9.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="../公共资源/样式/2d6f64a41592ecc5580f5c9af7df50312d13003a44b11a009e97a399d0f450fe.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="../公共资源/样式/0406149be904073c2ce7f9c463de30c838a7e631d14c8d5bb6a37504503d377b.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="../公共资源/样式/803029919eed32de8e6b562de1110670aa54f8c208a24d221e5d9aec09164500.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="../公共资源/样式/d5fece9265f8ae702d5f7a43c7726a744c7ed184259f0e2cb8a9cfd1cef19b94.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="../公共资源/样式/2da1f7cfd40bdcb9d85e54468d109c375ebeade01cfe9c94372762f7bb9200ed.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="../公共资源/样式/e0aa4d2e552f0df112cd943bd3ba39229da3836f54211ecabd618e977dfa3702.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="../公共资源/site.css"></head><body><a class="site-skip" href="#main-content">跳到正文</a><header class="site-header"><nav aria-label="主导航"><a href="../index.html">首页／界面入口</a><a href="../主题/主界面入口.html">主界面</a><a href="../工具/index.html">工具窗口</a><a href="../数据/index.html">数据与 Owner</a><a href="../主题/执行与状态.html">执行与结果</a><a href="../清单/交付与兼容.html">范围／兼容</a></nav><p class="breadcrumb">架构逆向与实现对照文档 / 全局变量：同流程、跨流程与停止</p><h1>全局变量：同流程、跨流程与停止</h1><p class="muted">原版事实、当前独立实现、拟议设计与未知分别保留。导航示意属于文档组织，不代表原程序的控件树或完整运行验证。</p><p id="route-message" role="status" hidden></p></header><main id="main-content" class="site-main"><p class="site-notice">本页正文与分类来自拆分前页面。长原文已迁移到内容寻址证据页，原始 SHA 和返回路径仍保留。</p><div class="source-content"><section id="global-variable-analysis"><h3>全局变量与后台执行：谁持有、何时可见、停止后谁还能写</h3><p class="dd-gap">本节分别说明原版 VM、REA 当前恢复实现、自研 SunEyeVision_V2 的只读源码快照。下面的设计建议不是已实施功能，也不是原版行为。无产品代码改动，无原版运行验证。</p><div id="global-variable-execution"><h4>全局变量：实际执行链与停止边界</h4><p>续追补入 25 个原生处理体，454 个汇编直接调用已对原 PE 重核。另续追消费者 18 个处理体、412 个原字节直接调用；重点结论见 GEX16–GEX25。GU01–GU05 保留已解决部分和精确剩余问题。</p><p class="dd-mini-chain">停止所选路径：工作循环离开 → SetEvent(+0x88)，此时停止等待可返回 → 尾部状态通知 → +0x1c8 收尾回调 → SetEvent(+0x98)</p><p class="dd-gap">自研运行探针已用一致源码在本工作区重建并通过 3 项断言；实际加载的 2 个程序集与 406 个 PDB 文档身份已核。仅限合成工具和私有调度入口，未运行原版、产品 UI 或切方案。旧失败日志保留，详见 GEX24/GEX25。</p><p>新增 45 个原生函数体、11 个原件 CIL 方法体；653 个直接调用点重新核对原 PE 字节。原机并发、停止实验未执行，下面每个结论都有具体成立范围。</p><p class="dd-mini-chain">原版：生产输出绑定 → 模块算法返回 → 按生产模块查绑定 → 条件加锁 → 解析当前源值 → 写变量记录 → 条件通知／解锁 → 消费者按名取当前存储</p><p class="dd-mini-chain">自研方案批次：编译生产／消费依赖 → await A → 发布成功节点输出到 runtimeGlobals → B 捕获字典快照 → 合成 __GlobalVars__ → 参数解析 → 工具执行</p><p class="dd-gap">两条图是已证片段的阅读顺序；SDK 到 ModuleFrame 的桥、所有消费者订阅和最后停止屏障仍按下方 GU01–GU05 明列。原版结果镜像中的 ExecuteCount 与原生全局变量存储分开。</p><div class="global-execution-diagrams"><figure data-global-diagram="global-publish" style="margin:18px 0"><figcaption><b>原版整数路径：流程输出经绑定发布到全局记录，消费者再读取</b><br>原件静态确认；上层同批调度未知</figcaption><div style="overflow-x:auto"><svg viewBox="0 0 1040 140" style="min-width:760px;width:100%;height:auto" role="img" aria-label="原版整数路径：流程输出经绑定发布到全局记录，消费者再读取"><title>原版整数路径：流程输出经绑定发布到全局记录，消费者再读取</title><a href="global-variable-analysis.html#GEX04"><rect x="12" y="28" width="230" height="76" rx="9" fill="#183144" stroke="#8dcaff"/><text x="24" y="56" fill="#edf6ff" font-size="15">生产模块输出</text><text x="24" y="82" fill="#b9d2e7" font-size="12">流程存储 key=0 · GEX04</text></a><path d="M 242 64 H 267 l -8 -5 m 8 5 l -8 5" fill="none" stroke="#8dcaff" stroke-width="2"/><a href="global-variable-analysis.html#GEX02"><rect x="272" y="28" width="230" height="76" rx="9" fill="#183144" stroke="#8dcaff"/><text x="284" y="56" fill="#edf6ff" font-size="15">模块完成后处理</text><text x="284" y="82" fill="#b9d2e7" font-size="12">绑定读取并复制值 · GEX02</text></a><path d="M 502 64 H 527 l -8 -5 m 8 5 l -8 5" fill="none" stroke="#8dcaff" stroke-width="2"/><a href="global-variable-analysis.html#GEX16"><rect x="532" y="28" width="230" height="76" rx="9" fill="#183144" stroke="#8dcaff"/><text x="544" y="56" fill="#edf6ff" font-size="15">静态全局记录</text><text x="544" y="82" fill="#b9d2e7" font-size="12">0x1802b2b50 · GEX16</text></a><path d="M 762 64 H 787 l -8 -5 m 8 5 l -8 5" fill="none" stroke="#8dcaff" stroke-width="2"/><a href="global-variable-analysis.html#GEX22"><rect x="792" y="28" width="230" height="76" rx="9" fill="#183144" stroke="#8dcaff"/><text x="804" y="56" fill="#edf6ff" font-size="15">全局来源消费者</text><text x="804" y="82" fill="#b9d2e7" font-size="12">读当前记录，失败回退 · GEX22</text></a></svg></div><p>实线：已取原体的值发布与读取；没有在这些读取体中按轮次查历史版本。上层是否保证同批，见 GU02。</p></figure><figure data-global-diagram="stop-order" style="margin:18px 0"><figcaption><b>原版停止：事件置位并非尾部回调结束</b><br>原件静态顺序；原机线程时序未验证</figcaption><div style="overflow-x:auto"><svg viewBox="0 0 1040 140" style="min-width:760px;width:100%;height:auto" role="img" aria-label="原版停止：事件置位并非尾部回调结束"><title>原版停止：事件置位并非尾部回调结束</title><a href="global-variable-analysis.html#GEX17"><rect x="12" y="28" width="230" height="76" rx="9" fill="#183144" stroke="#8dcaff"/><text x="24" y="56" fill="#edf6ff" font-size="15">工作循环离开</text><text x="24" y="82" fill="#b9d2e7" font-size="12">本轮工作函数已返回 · GEX17</text></a><path d="M 242 64 H 267 l -8 -5 m 8 5 l -8 5" fill="none" stroke="#8dcaff" stroke-width="2"/><a href="global-variable-analysis.html#GEX17"><rect x="272" y="28" width="230" height="76" rx="9" fill="#183144" stroke="#8dcaff"/><text x="284" y="56" fill="#edf6ff" font-size="15">SetEvent(+0x88)</text><text x="284" y="82" fill="#b9d2e7" font-size="12">停止等待可返回 · GEX17</text></a><path d="M 502 64 H 527 l -8 -5 m 8 5 l -8 5" fill="none" stroke="#8dcaff" stroke-width="2"/><a href="global-variable-analysis.html#GEX17"><rect x="532" y="28" width="230" height="76" rx="9" fill="#183144" stroke="#8dcaff"/><text x="544" y="56" fill="#edf6ff" font-size="15">尾部状态通知</text><text x="544" y="82" fill="#b9d2e7" font-size="12">随后执行 · GEX17</text></a><path d="M 762 64 H 787 l -8 -5 m 8 5 l -8 5" fill="none" stroke="#8dcaff" stroke-width="2"/><a href="global-variable-analysis.html#GEX17"><rect x="792" y="28" width="230" height="76" rx="9" fill="#183144" stroke="#8dcaff"/><text x="804" y="56" fill="#edf6ff" font-size="15">可选收尾函数</text><text x="804" y="82" fill="#b9d2e7" font-size="12">随后 +0x98 置位 · GEX17</text></a></svg></div><p>这里只说明已恢复工作循环的先后；最后全局写入、子任务及托管 UI 队列是否被屏障覆盖仍见 GU03。</p></figure><figure data-global-diagram="current-cancel-probe" style="margin:18px 0"><figcaption><b>自研有限运行：取消返回时，未响应取消的工具仍未结束</b><br>当前源码 net10 宿主 + 合成工具运行证据</figcaption><div style="overflow-x:auto"><svg viewBox="0 0 1040 140" style="min-width:760px;width:100%;height:auto" role="img" aria-label="自研有限运行：取消返回时，未响应取消的工具仍未结束"><title>自研有限运行：取消返回时，未响应取消的工具仍未结束</title><a href="global-variable-analysis.html#GEX25"><rect x="12" y="28" width="230" height="76" rx="9" fill="#183144" stroke="#8dcaff"/><text x="24" y="56" fill="#edf6ff" font-size="15">两工具均已进入</text><text x="24" y="82" fill="#b9d2e7" font-size="12">慢工具等待探针闸门 · GEX25</text></a><path d="M 242 64 H 267 l -8 -5 m 8 5 l -8 5" fill="none" stroke="#8dcaff" stroke-width="2"/><a href="global-variable-analysis.html#GEX25"><rect x="272" y="28" width="230" height="76" rx="9" fill="#183144" stroke="#8dcaff"/><text x="284" y="56" fill="#edf6ff" font-size="15">快工具完成</text><text x="284" y="82" fill="#b9d2e7" font-size="12">回调触发取消 · GEX25</text></a><path d="M 502 64 H 527 l -8 -5 m 8 5 l -8 5" fill="none" stroke="#8dcaff" stroke-width="2"/><a href="global-variable-analysis.html#GEX25"><rect x="532" y="28" width="230" height="76" rx="9" fill="#183144" stroke="#8dcaff"/><text x="544" y="56" fill="#edf6ff" font-size="15">队列取消返回</text><text x="544" y="82" fill="#b9d2e7" font-size="12">慢工具仍运行，计数 0 · GEX25</text></a><path d="M 762 64 H 787 l -8 -5 m 8 5 l -8 5" fill="none" stroke="#8dcaff" stroke-width="2"/><a href="global-variable-analysis.html#GEX25"><rect x="792" y="28" width="230" height="76" rx="9" fill="#183144" stroke="#8dcaff"/><text x="804" y="56" fill="#edf6ff" font-size="15">探针放开闸门</text><text x="804" y="82" fill="#b9d2e7" font-size="12">慢工具副作用计数 1 · GEX25</text></a></svg></div><p>合成副作用为测试计数器；未运行产品 UI、方案切换或原版，不据此声称产品界面已受旧结果污染。</p></figure></div><details open data-global-execution-scenario="same-flow"><summary>同流程：A 产生 X，B 读取 X</summary><p>原版已追到模块后更新与按名取当前值；直接订阅的 native 输入消费及完整调度边尚未闭合。自研普通全局参数读运行字典快照，接收变量另有服务分支，不能只凭局部 DAG 判断已读到 A 本轮结果。</p><div class="dd-stage-columns"><article><h4>原版：实际成员、分支和更新点</h4><p><a href="global-variable-analysis.html#GEX01">GEX01 · 生产绑定：模块输出 → 指定变量模块／变量名</a></p><p><a href="global-variable-analysis.html#GEX02">GEX02 · 实际更新时间：所选模块执行成功之后，不必等整个流程结束</a></p><p><a href="global-variable-analysis.html#GEX03">GEX03 · 按生产模块反查 → 加锁 → 逐变量类型处理 → 解锁</a></p><p><a href="global-variable-analysis.html#GEX04">GEX04 · 整数值：读取绑定描述指定的当前存储 → 按索引写目标</a></p><p><a href="global-variable-analysis.html#GEX05">GEX05 · 独立整数读取：按名称、索引返回当前值及总数量</a></p><p><a href="global-variable-analysis.html#GEX07">GEX07 · VmIO 执行计数检查属于结果读取，不是全局变量批次协议</a></p><p><a href="global-variable-analysis.html#GEX22">GEX22 · 消费者选择：识别全局来源后先读全局记录，失败回退流程记录</a></p></article><article><h4>自研：实际输入、提交和停止路径</h4><p><a href="global-variable-analysis.html#GEX10">GEX10 · 普通参数读取：本轮冻结的 __GlobalVars__ 合成结果</a></p><p><a href="global-variable-analysis.html#GEX11">GEX11 · 接收变量是另一条路径，不能与普通参数混为一谈</a></p><p><a href="global-variable-analysis.html#GEX24">GEX24 · 实测：已记录生产者新结果，普通全局绑定仍读取请求种子快照</a></p></article></div></details><details open data-global-execution-scenario="cross-flow"><summary>跨流程：A、B 谁先执行，读哪一轮</summary><p>选定整数链已连上：生产模块完成后复制值到静态全局记录；消费者识别全局来源后优先读该记录，失败回退流程存储。消费者取当时记录，不按生产轮次取历史版本；上层是否保证同批仍待调度证据。自研方案批次显式发布、普通全局快照和全部连续入口分开对照。</p><div class="dd-stage-columns"><article><h4>原版：实际成员、分支和更新点</h4><p><a href="global-variable-analysis.html#GEX01">GEX01 · 生产绑定：模块输出 → 指定变量模块／变量名</a></p><p><a href="global-variable-analysis.html#GEX02">GEX02 · 实际更新时间：所选模块执行成功之后，不必等整个流程结束</a></p><p><a href="global-variable-analysis.html#GEX05">GEX05 · 独立整数读取：按名称、索引返回当前值及总数量</a></p><p><a href="global-variable-analysis.html#GEX16">GEX16 · 先区分存储，再谈“读哪一轮”</a></p><p><a href="global-variable-analysis.html#GEX18">GEX18 · 连续运行计数属于所选流程记录，不能拿相等数字配跨流程批次</a></p><p><a href="global-variable-analysis.html#GEX22">GEX22 · 消费者选择：识别全局来源后先读全局记录，失败回退流程记录</a></p></article><article><h4>自研：实际输入、提交和停止路径</h4><p><a href="global-variable-analysis.html#GEX12">GEX12 · 跨流程方案批次确有生产→发布→消费链</a></p><p><a href="global-variable-analysis.html#GEX13">GEX13 · 全部单次／全部连续分别有独立入口</a></p></article></div></details><details open data-global-execution-scenario="continuous"><summary>后台连续：是否跨轮保留和何时通知</summary><p>已证的是模块完成后的变量绑定处理、按当前存储读取及条件通知；没有证据表明每轮自动全清空，或所有流程共享同一个轮次。自研持续请求复制种子字典，跨流程实时生产值同步尚缺同等发布链。</p><div class="dd-stage-columns"><article><h4>原版：实际成员、分支和更新点</h4><p><a href="global-variable-analysis.html#GEX02">GEX02 · 实际更新时间：所选模块执行成功之后，不必等整个流程结束</a></p><p><a href="global-variable-analysis.html#GEX03">GEX03 · 按生产模块反查 → 加锁 → 逐变量类型处理 → 解锁</a></p><p><a href="global-variable-analysis.html#GEX06">GEX06 · 锁状态与变更通知：不是停止代次门</a></p><p><a href="global-variable-analysis.html#GEX08">GEX08 · 连续与停止：托管等待 + 选定原生事件等待路径</a></p></article><article><h4>自研：实际输入、提交和停止路径</h4><p><a href="global-variable-analysis.html#GEX10">GEX10 · 普通参数读取：本轮冻结的 __GlobalVars__ 合成结果</a></p><p><a href="global-variable-analysis.html#GEX13">GEX13 · 全部单次／全部连续分别有独立入口</a></p></article></div></details><details open data-global-execution-scenario="stop"><summary>停止：旧结果是否还能写回</summary><p>原版 +0x88 事件先于尾部状态通知和收尾回调，尚未证最后提交屏障。自研真实私有就绪队列的选定取消路径已运行重现：取消返回时慢工具仍运行，随后可以完成合成副作用；这不等于已复现产品 UI 或全局值被旧结果污染。</p><div class="dd-stage-columns"><article><h4>原版：实际成员、分支和更新点</h4><p><a href="global-variable-analysis.html#GEX06">GEX06 · 锁状态与变更通知：不是停止代次门</a></p><p><a href="global-variable-analysis.html#GEX08">GEX08 · 连续与停止：托管等待 + 选定原生事件等待路径</a></p><p><a href="global-variable-analysis.html#GEX09">GEX09 · 迟到托管结果：入口没有按停止代次直接拒收</a></p><p><a href="global-variable-analysis.html#GEX17">GEX17 · 停止等待事件先置位，尾部通知和收尾回调随后执行</a></p></article><article><h4>自研：实际输入、提交和停止路径</h4><p><a href="global-variable-analysis.html#GEX14">GEX14 · 停止与切方案已有阻止新运行、取消和等待机制</a></p><p><a href="global-variable-analysis.html#GEX15">GEX15 · 外层等待不等于所有子任务已退出：finally未等待running任务</a></p><p><a href="global-variable-analysis.html#GEX25">GEX25 · 实测：选定取消路径先返回，未响应取消的工具随后仍可完成副作用</a></p><p><a href="global-variable-analysis.html#GEX26">GEX26 · 计算完成、调度器收集、UI缓存提交是三个不同的时刻</a></p></article></div></details><h4>按执行时刻展开源码</h4><details data-global-execution-fact="GEX01" id="GEX01"><summary>GEX01 · 原版 · 生产绑定：模块输出 → 指定变量模块／变量名</summary><p>VmModuleExtern.BindingGlobalVariable 调用 ConvertToBindRelationStruct，再交 GlobalModuleManager.BindGlobalVarParam。结构的 nModuleId/strParamName 是变量模块与变量名；stBindValue 中另保存生产模块 ID、输出参数名及 All 索引。不能把输入订阅、输出绑定与“运行参数联动”合为一种操作。原生 VM_M_BindGlobalVar 在所选循环交 0x9b560；后者保存绑定并经 0x9d8f0 为变量来源种类 3 建立按生产模块反查的两组索引。托管 SDK 到该 ModuleFrame 导出的实际桥仍单列未闭合。</p><p class="dd-gap">原SDK活实例 handle/moduleID 与 ModuleFrame 实例、加载副本未运行印证；不能仅凭相似方法名拼接完整调用。</p><details><summary>VmModuleExtern.BindingGlobalVariable · 1715–1754</summary><p>analysis/decompiled/Apps.XmlParser.CapabilityAudit/Apps.XmlParser.ParamTab/VmModuleExtern.cs</p><p>SHA256 4d4b726df4eac492c955502cb90118e793679ee74718b900e62625cfe2de2c9c · local-decompiled-source · not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="0b65e40e5cee337c504aea2d0b1da280431c4256e316001b749cf930dbf12e5a" href="../../证据/0b65e40e5cee337c504aea2d0b1da280431c4256e316001b749cf930dbf12e5a.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>0b65e40e5cee</small></a></details><details><summary>ConvertToVarBindRelationStruct · 1747–1817</summary><p>analysis/decompiled/Apps.XmlParser.CapabilityAudit/Apps.XmlParser.ParamTab/VmModuleExtern.cs</p><p>SHA256 4d4b726df4eac492c955502cb90118e793679ee74718b900e62625cfe2de2c9c · local-decompiled-source · not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="36b72449a884bdacecdccb93a57df05caab39e6b1fa6953406d9ff25c4f0ea49" href="../../证据/36b72449a884bdacecdccb93a57df05caab39e6b1fa6953406d9ff25c4f0ea49.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>36b72449a884</small></a></details><details><summary>GlobalModuleManager.BindGlobalVarParam · 32–43</summary><p>analysis/decompiled/VM.PlatformSDKCS.Audit/VM.PlatformSDKCS/GlobalModuleManager.cs</p><p>SHA256 ab2b834644df65e6a41bb76efc8bdc241f427c671afbd0f4d5c64237c34a6f13 · local-decompiled-source · not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="bd49530c611784488166033a044474caf7a86defcb3f5875564df31b1eae2e2e" href="../../证据/bd49530c611784488166033a044474caf7a86defcb3f5875564df31b1eae2e2e.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>bd49530c6117</small></a></details><details><summary>ModuleFrame!VM_M_BindGlobalVar @ 0x1801417d0 · 1–138</summary><p>docs/architecture-recovery/global-variable-execution.resources/native/1801417d0.c</p><p>SHA256 4c2c45bdf04a37aa10653922bdb9a2beb29b1cd264eff608d6444128e237f3cf · offline-ghidra-pseudocode · 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="87c33cea9674ad278d4003c605be3685767988edd5ca456fcd2611e6ffb8d243" href="../../证据/87c33cea9674ad278d4003c605be3685767988edd5ca456fcd2611e6ffb8d243.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>87c33cea9674</small></a></details><details><summary>ModuleFrame!VM_M_BindGlobalVar @ 0x1801417d0 · 1–190</summary><p>docs/architecture-recovery/global-variable-execution.resources/native/1801417d0.asm.txt</p><p>SHA256 2f99274964f0f6080f931cbd8b4237eb6662e518abc8cb48a1d38a2a9189b209 · offline-ghidra-assembly · 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="004931efea6d3d41f3761c1c8679c29b817755a76430ad5d83bdd79d14ce3b28" href="../../证据/004931efea6d3d41f3761c1c8679c29b817755a76430ad5d83bdd79d14ce3b28.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>004931efea6d</small></a></details><details><summary>ModuleFrame!FUN_18009b560 @ 0x18009b560 · 1–458</summary><p>docs/architecture-recovery/global-variable-execution.resources/native/18009b560.c</p><p>SHA256 d82a3a9a9e092d4d771afb40395435ddd1e3fe87eeeeaa6b30bfe02ef2ba35f9 · offline-ghidra-pseudocode · 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="caea045812f5579a96f1b480b598759f64fb29a1eab0c50899a341e4346b08df" href="../../证据/caea045812f5579a96f1b480b598759f64fb29a1eab0c50899a341e4346b08df.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>caea045812f5</small></a></details><details><summary>ModuleFrame!FUN_18009b560 @ 0x18009b560 · 1–487</summary><p>docs/architecture-recovery/global-variable-execution.resources/native/18009b560.asm.txt</p><p>SHA256 fd1c67940441cbc8f9707b9931c2a9c06253afc993a48e717104cefc0214434d · offline-ghidra-assembly · 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="498b214b986c671aee77f727c81f26f068cb4b3623998cc67ce650bcd46fd68c" href="../../证据/498b214b986c671aee77f727c81f26f068cb4b3623998cc67ce650bcd46fd68c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>498b214b986c</small></a></details><details><summary>ModuleFrame!FUN_18009d8f0 @ 0x18009d8f0 · 1–187</summary><p>docs/architecture-recovery/global-variable-execution.resources/native/18009d8f0.c</p><p>SHA256 2c25e491504ce285b52e5fe5ffb0afb0879ec452a018fecd338199b5ba8d0ce8 · offline-ghidra-pseudocode · 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="533a429dc46fc661f68c273cec7628d6bf3e242a48ca95a370c3d6b0c7f874d5" href="../../证据/533a429dc46fc661f68c273cec7628d6bf3e242a48ca95a370c3d6b0c7f874d5.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>533a429dc46f</small></a></details><details><summary>ModuleFrame!FUN_18009d8f0 @ 0x18009d8f0 · 1–207</summary><p>docs/architecture-recovery/global-variable-execution.resources/native/18009d8f0.asm.txt</p><p>SHA256 f5f0c345d8190692ac6c2fafe03a765f5ae6fe7a512c70f696050317de4906d5 · offline-ghidra-assembly · 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="ef590261f708971e7d008854fc868e5e51bb39a2b1725591243d834438283000" href="../../证据/ef590261f708971e7d008854fc868e5e51bb39a2b1725591243d834438283000.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>ef590261f708</small></a></details></details><details data-global-execution-fact="GEX02" id="GEX02"><summary>GEX02 · 原版 · 实际更新时间：所选模块执行成功之后，不必等整个流程结束</summary><p>0xb8740 读取模块记录 +0x128 的对象，经主虚表 +8 执行算法，保存返回码；在所选尾部仅当该码为 0 时以同模块 +0x2c 的 ID 调 0x93b20。随后才继续 0xc9ea0 等后处理。另两处已取原体的调用点为 0xa0930（bVar11 条件）和 0x100e00（该分支直接调用）；不把三个分支都说成同一成功门。因而已证至少存在“单模块完成后处理生产绑定”的实际路径，而非仅凭绑定配置推定更新。</p><p class="dd-gap">+8 动态算法具体实现及所有执行模式的分派仍按各工具取证；本条不宣称所有模块、失败码或 native mode 共用同一成功门。</p><details><summary>ModuleFrame!FUN_1800b8740 @ 0x1800b8740 · 1–446</summary><p>docs/architecture-recovery/global-variable-execution.resources/native/1800b8740.c</p><p>SHA256 0e45fbd8dee40b1b66de096a032578b2c04025079a18b2af1a6e6db290f3ec12 · offline-ghidra-pseudocode · 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="002db9aff11aea2cff5b120fad7cb67bcf1020e5358462643abb4678516d9029" href="../../证据/002db9aff11aea2cff5b120fad7cb67bcf1020e5358462643abb4678516d9029.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>002db9aff11a</small></a></details><details><summary>ModuleFrame!FUN_1800b8740 @ 0x1800b8740 · 1–590</summary><p>docs/architecture-recovery/global-variable-execution.resources/native/1800b8740.asm.txt</p><p>SHA256 7b8f6946248443ee756b19be603c9a56ff48041d0b6e571db59a1cddb4b3088d · offline-ghidra-assembly · 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d482c2a9997b07778f4ae5e28a060d19e1a951198a8b5103539c3d556c8ec5be" href="../../证据/d482c2a9997b07778f4ae5e28a060d19e1a951198a8b5103539c3d556c8ec5be.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d482c2a9997b</small></a></details><details><summary>ModuleFrame!FUN_1800a0930 @ 0x1800a0930 · 1–1171</summary><p>docs/architecture-recovery/global-variable-execution.resources/native/1800a0930.c</p><p>SHA256 00f98b34f4db17d51eba3c94fbfe059465fbf076def452760ca3148391a7ac7b · offline-ghidra-pseudocode · 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="371ea2ce71c4dd5d8bee604f5bce83cb0b86025ab3156690aa5dfcaf19705397" href="../../证据/371ea2ce71c4dd5d8bee604f5bce83cb0b86025ab3156690aa5dfcaf19705397.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>371ea2ce71c4</small></a></details><details><summary>ModuleFrame!FUN_1800a0930 @ 0x1800a0930 · 1–1428</summary><p>docs/architecture-recovery/global-variable-execution.resources/native/1800a0930.asm.txt</p><p>SHA256 c45abb8f997fbb9174c3029b8642c444abdd7921ba06ca2ef22e87f54342070b · offline-ghidra-assembly · 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="06bfca772e0c418a27b35e860daa23999a8a75c620fdb4dcd83c414ab80e49f6" href="../../证据/06bfca772e0c418a27b35e860daa23999a8a75c620fdb4dcd83c414ab80e49f6.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>06bfca772e0c</small></a></details><details><summary>ModuleFrame!FUN_180100e00 @ 0x180100e00 · 1–230</summary><p>docs/architecture-recovery/global-variable-execution.resources/native/180100e00.c</p><p>SHA256 ae29593067ca95db31652f3fa822d82dfab23c59e36a226ed174e0a06a78e793 · offline-ghidra-pseudocode · 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="0f526d81d8564c20cd88138ffd0ec5079fc20cf01663cdcc8f43fda60dd6a04c" href="../../证据/0f526d81d8564c20cd88138ffd0ec5079fc20cf01663cdcc8f43fda60dd6a04c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>0f526d81d856</small></a></details><details><summary>ModuleFrame!FUN_180100e00 @ 0x180100e00 · 1–307</summary><p>docs/architecture-recovery/global-variable-execution.resources/native/180100e00.asm.txt</p><p>SHA256 fb9044ae0606337084c6e52e3690c0c2f2905c2027b5613c7eb60ceede0e9976 · offline-ghidra-assembly · 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="4cecbca31c0c0683e5959989c87af3fd7e7fab40b6e47fdd8cdb43863c30804b" href="../../证据/4cecbca31c0c0683e5959989c87af3fd7e7fab40b6e47fdd8cdb43863c30804b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>4cecbca31c0c</small></a></details></details><details data-global-execution-fact="GEX03" id="GEX03"><summary>GEX03 · 原版 · 按生产模块反查 → 加锁 → 逐变量类型处理 → 解锁</summary><p>0x93b20 在模式字节允许的分支调用 0x9df90，用生产模块 ID 取绑定集合。报告关闭分支直接逐项交 0x94190；报告开启分支另从 0x9e0f0 取相关变量模块 ID，逐个调 0x9a140(...,1)，然后逐项处理绑定，再对相关模块调 0x9a140(...,0)。0x94190 的类型分派为 1→0x94700、2→0x94c80、3→0x957d0、4→0x95f40、5→0x964e0、6→0x96a60、7→0x95230；本轮补取了 int/float/string 的处理体，其他四个类型仅确认分派目标。</p><p class="dd-gap">这些锁属于选定报告分支，不能宣称跨全部工作流建立整批事务；四种未补取的值处理体保持具体地址断点。</p><details><summary>ModuleFrame!FUN_180093b20 @ 0x180093b20 · 1–314</summary><p>docs/architecture-recovery/global-variable-execution.resources/native/180093b20.c</p><p>SHA256 9d4b4d0c1e8e5b77efc254fba308946940bfde30406d59c35c99dfa154a600cc · offline-ghidra-pseudocode · 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="8b8ef9dd1b6fa30fdf700d7aebd4513f2699f7d12be0ba4ad89aa2a792d42f49" href="../../证据/8b8ef9dd1b6fa30fdf700d7aebd4513f2699f7d12be0ba4ad89aa2a792d42f49.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>8b8ef9dd1b6f</small></a></details><details><summary>ModuleFrame!FUN_180093b20 @ 0x180093b20 · 1–462</summary><p>docs/architecture-recovery/global-variable-execution.resources/native/180093b20.asm.txt</p><p>SHA256 26dddc79def1e33283f2040b1dd99ac70cf419bd7b3dabd45e3865660501eda4 · offline-ghidra-assembly · 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d6fe2e5ad9242420cb5f1a6002be52e5a26dd138beb19b4f0cadd56cf7fd44e5" href="../../证据/d6fe2e5ad9242420cb5f1a6002be52e5a26dd138beb19b4f0cadd56cf7fd44e5.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d6fe2e5ad924</small></a></details><details><summary>ModuleFrame!FUN_18009df90 @ 0x18009df90 · 1–85</summary><p>docs/architecture-recovery/global-variable-execution.resources/native/18009df90.c</p><p>SHA256 324c8a90ba6e489ea619819e094c1a0c4431830a670a13b3d3025dc4a0ba2d79 · offline-ghidra-pseudocode · 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d942ecf896854b632d9498aa681202a0a5724858800c846dc5a78ca330104d3a" href="../../证据/d942ecf896854b632d9498aa681202a0a5724858800c846dc5a78ca330104d3a.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d942ecf89685</small></a></details><details><summary>ModuleFrame!FUN_18009df90 @ 0x18009df90 · 1–96</summary><p>docs/architecture-recovery/global-variable-execution.resources/native/18009df90.asm.txt</p><p>SHA256 5ae12977755506be9afb524d26c2d12195edac6ab7287c366b5b0daa2a443da7 · offline-ghidra-assembly · 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="62c5a049f693fb5c05da81dee8ad9b8d8a60ab69cd63ba27904e5a4b3d1a01f8" href="../../证据/62c5a049f693fb5c05da81dee8ad9b8d8a60ab69cd63ba27904e5a4b3d1a01f8.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>62c5a049f693</small></a></details><details><summary>ModuleFrame!FUN_18009e0f0 @ 0x18009e0f0 · 1–60</summary><p>docs/architecture-recovery/global-variable-execution.resources/native/18009e0f0.c</p><p>SHA256 080ca70451c02367b8b282611c98a9df971b385dab9034e36f214f13bc57a591 · offline-ghidra-pseudocode · 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="ad23357b7060d01b70bb384d4ba5097827ae7a0603a618f9c0e9b3cf73368ae7" href="../../证据/ad23357b7060d01b70bb384d4ba5097827ae7a0603a618f9c0e9b3cf73368ae7.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>ad23357b7060</small></a></details><details><summary>ModuleFrame!FUN_18009e0f0 @ 0x18009e0f0 · 1–68</summary><p>docs/architecture-recovery/global-variable-execution.resources/native/18009e0f0.asm.txt</p><p>SHA256 e605cbb4915508e1f7802f0bd1e7b8df3e7d798bcc263e2b58eb5fb8fd1b5e6a · offline-ghidra-assembly · 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e40a5e7cdbf72a3a2219c1f6ab2a7a9612275158b5e4ccf2de89a45f8092d590" href="../../证据/e40a5e7cdbf72a3a2219c1f6ab2a7a9612275158b5e4ccf2de89a45f8092d590.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e40a5e7cdbf7</small></a></details><details><summary>ModuleFrame!FUN_180094190 @ 0x180094190 · 1–219</summary><p>docs/architecture-recovery/global-variable-execution.resources/native/180094190.c</p><p>SHA256 11b36878b7e1964fcdfd010f515facd56ce0a7d676adde3d24aa2d8a7783a19a · offline-ghidra-pseudocode · 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="dcc9f3f07b6af64ca3ce14c6a79befd0b69107ad7676640741032ef962164668" href="../../证据/dcc9f3f07b6af64ca3ce14c6a79befd0b69107ad7676640741032ef962164668.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>dcc9f3f07b6a</small></a></details><details><summary>ModuleFrame!FUN_180094190 @ 0x180094190 · 1–87</summary><p>docs/architecture-recovery/global-variable-execution.resources/native/180094190.asm.txt</p><p>SHA256 699ebd520396e11d87ab2b9c4e7bfc0cfdd07beaa71979b2b268f34f860611d9 · offline-ghidra-assembly · 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="9d565e06a45ef41fb893271d9d971894df0f88ff8af618dcd1a4c49bb14993fe" href="../../证据/9d565e06a45ef41fb893271d9d971894df0f88ff8af618dcd1a4c49bb14993fe.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>9d565e06a45e</small></a></details></details><details data-global-execution-fact="GEX04" id="GEX04"><summary>GEX04 · 原版 · 整数值：读取绑定描述指定的当前存储 → 按索引写目标</summary><p>0x94700 逐索引调用 0x96fe0 取绑定值，再交 0x98630 写目标变量。0x96fe0 的描述种类 3 读取 +0x8c 来源模块 ID 与 +0x90 来源名，经 0xca500 按模块／名称／索引取值；种类 1 常量和种类 2 的另一来源分支另列，不用伪码 void 签名否认隐藏栈参数。0x98630 取目标模块记录后，经 0xf47f0 找名称值对象，再交 0xf3ee0。该叶体对负索引报错；已有索引直接向载荷 [+0x70 数组 +8+index*4] 写 4 字节，否则必要时扩容并在尾部追加，再增数量 +0x68。值在这里实际写入内部数组，不是仅转发指针。这些值读写 API 参数是模块、名称、索引、值／数量，所选路径未见全局 BatchId 或消费者要求的 ExecuteCount 参数。</p><p class="dd-gap">这是选定整数绑定路径的静态合同，不把它外推为所有插件输入均调用同一函数；索引选择助手 0x99be0 与复杂订阅仍另需逐体核对。</p><details><summary>ModuleFrame!FUN_180094700 @ 0x180094700 · 1–295</summary><p>docs/architecture-recovery/global-variable-execution.resources/native/180094700.c</p><p>SHA256 3d72fc6d388f17e0fc4dc923402d4dfd44268445ab71502e352427295afc2c78 · offline-ghidra-pseudocode · 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="11270b391de5bb8645751605a3ed76d7becd647914424b675b39629da3a2b11e" href="../../证据/11270b391de5bb8645751605a3ed76d7becd647914424b675b39629da3a2b11e.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>11270b391de5</small></a></details><details><summary>ModuleFrame!FUN_180094700 @ 0x180094700 · 1–331</summary><p>docs/architecture-recovery/global-variable-execution.resources/native/180094700.asm.txt</p><p>SHA256 ee2928bbc2d3a7e9ddadfee59a6c94fb53cc82125b97f18418a01606cd81f764 · offline-ghidra-assembly · 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="76784178b2d739c6cea24b998da7382481e47cbe22d5317d2b961b35151ba17c" href="../../证据/76784178b2d739c6cea24b998da7382481e47cbe22d5317d2b961b35151ba17c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>76784178b2d7</small></a></details><details><summary>ModuleFrame!FUN_180096fe0 @ 0x180096fe0 · 1–153</summary><p>docs/architecture-recovery/global-variable-execution.resources/native/180096fe0.c</p><p>SHA256 3132527a75cb8137346b1335ea43386012aa0a2ea68f652ff9fdc7c246060c83 · offline-ghidra-pseudocode · 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="328b29d595c5b266085f70fe558d0cd44a9fb65a1de56d4a3435b03e319d2726" href="../../证据/328b29d595c5b266085f70fe558d0cd44a9fb65a1de56d4a3435b03e319d2726.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>328b29d595c5</small></a></details><details><summary>ModuleFrame!FUN_180096fe0 @ 0x180096fe0 · 1–193</summary><p>docs/architecture-recovery/global-variable-execution.resources/native/180096fe0.asm.txt</p><p>SHA256 b2c31322b154a8a151978ebda9423f4609c02e4554607f9cd4e4a51ecbbb1971 · offline-ghidra-assembly · 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="4aaee034f09b07a67d4b17d58440cde5f87ccce372bea7bae78c2d6f92745afc" href="../../证据/4aaee034f09b07a67d4b17d58440cde5f87ccce372bea7bae78c2d6f92745afc.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>4aaee034f09b</small></a></details><details><summary>ModuleFrame!FUN_180098630 @ 0x180098630 · 1–80</summary><p>docs/architecture-recovery/global-variable-execution.resources/native/180098630.c</p><p>SHA256 eb4b7029a0172a983a02ad4e11d08d9450ed55bf89fdd6d59cb55d420dda7f84 · offline-ghidra-pseudocode · 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="9fb66d67b28280be50a2779efa0f357ad0c9a57f2026f3767f0cd0a6af181037" href="../../证据/9fb66d67b28280be50a2779efa0f357ad0c9a57f2026f3767f0cd0a6af181037.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>9fb66d67b282</small></a></details><details><summary>ModuleFrame!FUN_180098630 @ 0x180098630 · 1–109</summary><p>docs/architecture-recovery/global-variable-execution.resources/native/180098630.asm.txt</p><p>SHA256 f69db98e461e04e5e6c0f091ee86f1a1c455dc0c7422d8046857f50565ca7d21 · offline-ghidra-assembly · 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="0cd091a278dca7957eb718fa12433cb675ab68fd0c366dc17b4a49b2f650841e" href="../../证据/0cd091a278dca7957eb718fa12433cb675ab68fd0c366dc17b4a49b2f650841e.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>0cd091a278dc</small></a></details><details><summary>ModuleFrame!FUN_1800f47f0 @ 0x1800f47f0 · 1–38</summary><p>docs/architecture-recovery/global-variable-execution.resources/native/1800f47f0.c</p><p>SHA256 04d40201b0c6a1faa59b1fb93555cec1d7f64a3bf15e1b9d7bd1c81cff4c6daa · offline-ghidra-pseudocode · 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4