d1a2ddbf60887.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>550ba4ebec03</small></a></details></details><details data-global-execution-fact="GEX05" id="GEX05"><summary>GEX05 · 原版 · 独立整数读取：按名称、索引返回当前值及总数量</summary><p>VM_M_GetGlobalVarInt 重排句柄、名称、索引、输出地址与数量地址到 0x127470；内部由句柄首 int 取模块键，进入 0xca500→0xf5f40。0xf5f40 取具名值对象后，从载荷 +0x68 读总数量，并从 [+0x70 指向数组 +8+index*4] 复制一个值到输出地址。负索引／超界返回错误，空记录另有错误。它读取的是本次调用时取得的存储，接口没有指定某轮的输入参数；这不单独证明上层调度是否另有配对。</p><p class="dd-gap">不能把“读取当前存储”改称观察到并发旧值；未进行原机并发实验。</p><details><summary>ModuleFrame!VM_M_GetGlobalVarInt @ 0x180134b60 · 1–66</summary><p>docs/architecture-recovery/global-variable-execution.resources/native/180134b60.c</p><p>SHA256 3478c301bf799dfbbab0c281601a76d8384169684cea30f500c47e6d578a6467 · offline-ghidra-pseudocode · 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="7c5aab989580177413dc89d61e774a9f4b6882f169bc7886be01efd2f61e2fc7" href="../../证据/7c5aab989580177413dc89d61e774a9f4b6882f169bc7886be01efd2f61e2fc7.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>7c5aab989580</small></a></details><details><summary>ModuleFrame!VM_M_GetGlobalVarInt @ 0x180134b60 · 1–97</summary><p>docs/architecture-recovery/global-variable-execution.resources/native/180134b60.asm.txt</p><p>SHA256 f59ff60304b1890fa727b189fe18f69a3e3f5d27f587bdbe04553c47ffee0e7e · offline-ghidra-assembly · 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="eb775ce3f5e5c5a0281e2c04c2957e4084365691e9818a30899caa8c50fedc06" href="../../证据/eb775ce3f5e5c5a0281e2c04c2957e4084365691e9818a30899caa8c50fedc06.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>eb775ce3f5e5</small></a></details><details><summary>ModuleFrame!FUN_180127470 @ 0x180127470 · 1–69</summary><p>docs/architecture-recovery/global-variable-execution.resources/native/180127470.c</p><p>SHA256 5eff533878dbe2d98085596633c2647a59be6049186953140752de6fdab2cad6 · offline-ghidra-pseudocode · 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590