9e5160a1b75505639dc26bcf1770290168" href="../../证据/612baa63eb0eb6f7acd00484a3c73d9e5160a1b75505639dc26bcf1770290168.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>612baa63eb0e</small></a></details><details><summary>platform!FUN_18062b200 @ 0x18062b200 · 1–187</summary><p>docs/architecture-recovery/global-variable-followup.resources/platform-route/18062b200.c</p><p>SHA256 3e5682fb57a93cc84718468b088a186710a8643245d46da03cb8006fa6873bd8 · offline-ghidra-pseudocode · 06d86f51bebfeba357d1b79297e20a3b0a70580a40af7b77c8abdd6c38ca0624</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="01fbe59954e784c8f7000849bee64ba1130cf2bafa6b45af8231cdc4daa57f29" href="../../证据/01fbe59954e784c8f7000849bee64ba1130cf2bafa6b45af8231cdc4daa57f29.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>01fbe59954e7</small></a></details><details><summary>platform!FUN_18062b200 @ 0x18062b200 · 1–186</summary><p>docs/architecture-recovery/global-variable-followup.resources/platform-route/18062b200.asm.txt</p><p>SHA256 f8072a270190998369531ebe5ce4aa4849e0b8e008db1914526281b173cf75e1 · offline-ghidra-assembly · 06d86f51bebfeba357d1b79297e20a3b0a70580a40af7b77c8abdd6c38ca0624</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="5db695a01af661a9062f266cbc1fd3164d76123eb766c54decec82af536129bd" href="../../证据/5db695a01af661a9062f266cbc1fd3164d76123eb766c54decec82af536129bd.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>5db695a01af6</small></a></details></details><details data-global-execution-fact="GEX21" id="GEX21"><summary>GEX21 · 原版 · 其余四种类型已取得处理体，复制与释放继续按类型追</summary><p>0x94190 的种类 4/5/6/7 目标 0x95f40、0x964e0、0x96a60、0x95230 本轮均已取得原体和汇编。前三级处理分别调用 0x97d10→0x98ae0、0x97f40→0x98e00、0x98150→0x99100；种类 7 调 0x97610→0x98950。处理体包含逐项读取、失败退出及条件报告路径，种类 7 还可见字符串容器复制／赋值和共享引用计数操作。已从“只有分派目标”推进到具体处理体，但未仅凭类型编号给种类 4/5/6/7 虚造图像或结构类型名称，也未把局部引用减计数当成整个像素缓冲区已经释放。</p><p class="dd-gap">上述八个内层读写包装器现已取到，见 GEX23；最内层复杂载荷、别名及最终释放继续按实际成员追，不能以包装器减引用代替最终释放结论。</p><details><summary>frame!FUN_180095f40 @ 0x180095f40 · 1–286</summary><p>docs/architecture-recovery/global-variable-followup.resources/frame-read-stop/180095f40.c</p><p>SHA256 075824c86c734f1e1b4e8df94892d70c8ac3c267d3c0e7a46456e3916b438795 · offline-ghidra-pseudocode · 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="5ab9ec96bd0ac8839a5f9e2735901c344faf578438890c210d54e072b21c186c" href="../../证据/5ab9ec96bd0ac8839a5f9e2735901c344faf578438890c210d54e072b21c186c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>5ab9ec96bd0a</small></a></details><details><summary>frame!FUN_180095f40 @ 0x180095f40 · 1–331</summary><p>docs/architecture-recovery/global-variable-followup.resources/frame-read-stop/180095f40.asm.txt</p><p>SHA256 c55c32e67df1aa7243af8b089c48bbdac910197e6734006a5dfc2571979e4671 · offline-ghidra-assembly · 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="b2d9bd617faadc5ac04464ac9cbaf441b6d782aa376cb5ee7e271a5f02d2a3a1" href="../../证据/b2d9bd617faadc5ac04464ac9cbaf441b6d782aa376cb5ee7e271a5f02d2a3a1.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>b2d9bd617faa</small></a></details><details><summary>frame!FUN_1800964e0 @ 0x1800964e0 · 1–283</summary><p>docs/architecture-recovery/global-variable-followup.resources/frame-read-stop/1800964e0.c</p><p>SHA256 2eb22acf6634f4dbbe4a971307f663323a3ba7c0d8767057549af226982c017d · offline-ghidra-pseudocode · 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f45ea0d2b4d04ea6543cc1a8467f8323fa5174fa7b0ed1b8a18560c4800b9cef" href="../../证据/f45ea0d2b4d04ea6543cc1a8467f8323fa5174fa7b0ed1b8a18560c4800b9cef.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f45ea0d2b4d0</small></a></details><details><summary>frame!FUN_1800964e0 @ 0x1800964e0 · 1–327</summary><p>docs/architecture-recovery/global-variable-followup.resources/frame-read-stop/1800964e0.asm.txt</p><p>SHA256 f5c55c7178ca468dcc522ec92f08436fa8d1517f15a92ad6211579c75779432b · offline-ghidra-assembly · 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd