d86acd7fc936fee806b61b8f.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d78b14aa55bf</small></a></details><details><summary>frame!FUN_180095230 @ 0x180095230 · 1–334</summary><p>docs/architecture-recovery/global-variable-followup.resources/frame-read-stop/180095230.asm.txt</p><p>SHA256 6bdbe0d2054d49d0947d164dfa10f76815859b5fc5ec88155af974b9f09eb7cd · offline-ghidra-assembly · 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="9051cdf9e5ce0347410d30c5c08584fe63cd77e4f85a0c172a1d3dced0563c1f" href="../../证据/9051cdf9e5ce0347410d30c5c08584fe63cd77e4f85a0c172a1d3dced0563c1f.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>9051cdf9e5ce</small></a></details></details><details data-global-execution-fact="GEX22" id="GEX22"><summary>GEX22 · 原版 · 消费者选择：识别全局来源后先读全局记录，失败回退流程记录</summary><p>0xbb4d0 在来源描述种类 3 分支读取生产模块 ID 与参数名，调用 0xbcd20 判断来源。0xbcd20 以模块 ID 经 0x10a720 找记录，仅当记录 +0x28 等于 10999 或 100000 时返回真。真分支进入门 0x1802b1208，先经 0x8e910→0xca500 读取静态全局记录；非零返回时再经 0x8e6c0(0)→0xca500 回退。假分支直接读流程存储。0xca500→0xf5f40 按模块、名称、索引和当时元素数量取值：整数有效索引读当前 4 字节；没有在该分支按消费者 ExecuteCount 或指定生产轮次检索历史版本。因而已成功发布且尚未被覆盖的值可在此读到；若消费者先于新发布运行，也没有这个读函数自身等待“本轮生产完成”的机制。</p><p class="dd-gap">记录字段 +0x28 的比较、先读和回退已按原体确认；所有消费者入口与上层是否禁止跨轮读取，仍须从调度调用者核对。不能把无本地轮次检查扩写成整个产品没有同步。</p><details><summary>ModuleFrame!FUN_1800bb4d0 @ 0x1800bb4d0 · 1–206</summary><p>docs/architecture-recovery/global-variable-consumer.resources/frame-registration/1800bb4d0.c</p><p>SHA256 9310565811fface4e5706e3e37083c3a6119dd0d600694a005ed8023407e1770 · offline-ghidra-pseudocode · 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="787c79ab4a1a835d6723dc747ca8e142f0e1118853a27467b17c945a2b329e32" href="../../证据/787c79ab4a1a835d6723dc747ca8e142f0e1118853a27467b17c945a2b329e32.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>787c79ab4a1a</small></a></details><details><summary>ModuleFrame!FUN_1800bb4d0 @ 0x1800bb4d0 · 1–265</summary><p>docs/architecture-recovery/global-variable-consumer.resources/frame-registration/1800bb4d0.asm.txt</p><p>SHA256 9526b965a712518fa76dc2b343660ccc03f2c98e7f7eff75a3b9c2e589d7d9e7 · offline-ghidra-assembly · 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="fd695b42352490690ba37acf9753cfa64b84c4d72af6255713702d3c8b0afe36" href="../../证据/fd695b42352490690ba37acf9753cfa64b84c4d72af6255713702d3c8b0afe36.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>fd695b423524</small></a></details><details><summary>ModuleFrame!FUN_1800bcd20 @ 0x1800bcd20 · 1–53</summary><p>docs/architecture-recovery/global-variable-consumer.resources/frame-consumer/1800bcd20.c</p><p>SHA256 7730943308d3d7e960f627ba947d3e1afb3dd00f1eef501b6667061b35d224f3 · offline-ghidra-pseudocode · 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="bfa8031c041fd970a673a34be2b58f2b2da6ac72074230745a06aa55ccb387e2" href="../../证据/bfa8031c041fd970a673a34be2b58f2b2da6ac72074230745a06aa55ccb387e2.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>bfa8031c041f</small></a></details><details><summary>ModuleFrame!FUN_1800bcd20 @ 0x1800bcd20 · 1–55</summary><p>docs/architecture-recovery/global-variable-consumer.resources/frame-consumer/1800bcd20.asm.txt</p><p>SHA256 a8074ecc5af93ace87e99a35cdf1be882c4a6b86c71adf808d25c492e7f18e8b · offline-ghidra-assembly · 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="eed2345b354e3527b91717c023300da4e706195689df31ffaa8ba13cdb6b112b" href="../../证据/eed2345b354e3527b91717c023300da4e706195689df31ffaa8ba13cdb6b112b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>eed2345b354e</small></a></details><details><summary>ModuleFrame!FUN_1800ca500 @ 0x1800ca500 · 1–60</summary><p>docs/architecture-recovery/global-variable-execution.resources/native/1800ca500.c</p><p>SHA256 05d10e73b6d49892de52679af9c07043400637be9f7d269f86c532197f961e9e · offline-ghidra-pseudocode · 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a