73a3edbb07c8fb3ccf916474a5f694963384402.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>96f4ffcb2f72</small></a></details></details><details data-global-execution-fact="GEX23" id="GEX23"><summary>GEX23 · 原版 · 读取策略因路径而异，不能画成所有输入共用一个全局读取器</summary><p>字符串读取路径 0x11d440 同样先按来源判断读全局或流程，但其全局失败回退排除了 0xE0000012；整数路径 0xbb4d0 则对非零返回执行回退。索引助手 0x124d40 也存在全局优先和失败回退。另一方面，种类 4 的绑定源读取 0x97d10 直接走 0x8e6c0(0)→0xcaa60；种类 5、6 的已恢复读者分别走 0xcaba0、0xcacd0，种类 7 走 0xca940。其目的写入 0x98ae0、0x98e00、0x99100、0x98950 则可见对静态全局记录取引用并调用各自写入成员。必须把“从生产输出取值”和“工具参数消费全局值”画成两种操作；读取来源、失败回退和复制细节逐路径保留。</p><p class="dd-gap">图像／复合载荷最内层写成员及最终内存释放仍不能只凭包装器确定；此处不虚构类型名称，不把所有字段都当成标量。</p><details><summary>ModuleFrame!FUN_18011d440 @ 0x18011d440 · 1–394</summary><p>docs/architecture-recovery/global-variable-consumer.resources/frame-registration/18011d440.c</p><p>SHA256 57668fec75a62aa4ad6362ff3acf8ca93da2080414ff62396eeb65167978fa3a · offline-ghidra-pseudocode · 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="fd850cffa222b08e069d11d7b08e5f07762402686c4947dfd59b0eceb2bf4d55" href="../../证据/fd850cffa222b08e069d11d7b08e5f07762402686c4947dfd59b0eceb2bf4d55.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>fd850cffa222</small></a></details><details><summary>ModuleFrame!FUN_18011d440 @ 0x18011d440 · 1–507</summary><p>docs/architecture-recovery/global-variable-consumer.resources/frame-registration/18011d440.asm.txt</p><p>SHA256 3cd0f2df326c80a36ba74680c90dfa760a3b4fedc9b9663d10a2b25e602e118c · offline-ghidra-assembly · 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="c21634634098d7ccb8c1061611414136984655722182d498996ecb0e5a4bf059" href="../../证据/c21634634098d7ccb8c1061611414136984655722182d498996ecb0e5a4bf059.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>c21634634098</small></a></details><details><summary>ModuleFrame!FUN_180124d40 @ 0x180124d40 · 1–142</summary><p>docs/architecture-recovery/global-variable-consumer.resources/frame-regis